"并存版文件 SHA256": ["SHA256 APK affiancabile", "Side-by-side APK SHA256"],
"lab1／lab2 更新包 SHA256": ["Aggiornamento lab1/lab2: SHA256", "lab1/lab2 update APK SHA256"],
"ChinaTech 0.2 旧版参考": ["ChinaTech 0.2: riferimento precedente", "ChinaTech 0.2 legacy reference"],
"ChinaTech 0.2 保留下载作参考；已发现原生 TLS 连接缺陷，修复尚未随旧包发布。建议使用上方 lab3，不将此旧包视为已可完成迁移。": ["ChinaTech 0.2 resta scaricabile come riferimento. È stato trovato un difetto nella connessione TLS nativa; il vecchio APK non contiene la correzione. Usa preferibilmente lab3 sopra; questo vecchio APK non prova una migrazione funzionante.", "ChinaTech 0.2 remains downloadable for reference. A native TLS connection defect was found; the old APK does not include the fix. Prefer lab3 above; this old APK must not be treated as a working migration release."],
"下载 ChinaTech 0.2 旧包": ["Scarica il vecchio APK ChinaTech 0.2", "Download legacy ChinaTech 0.2 APK"],
"ChinaTech 0.2 旧版步骤": ["ChinaTech 0.2: passaggi precedenti", "ChinaTech 0.2 legacy instructions"],
"ChinaTech 0.2 旧版规划": ["ChinaTech 0.2: piano precedente", "ChinaTech 0.2 legacy planning"],
"Smart Switch 通用通道实验版": ["Smart Switch: canale universale sperimentale", "Smart Switch universal-channel experiment"],
